ibes a 45 to 60 day notice period.", "t0": 20.11, "t1": 23.58, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "resolution", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Board resolution", "mark": "Board resolution"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.37, 0.93, 1.4, 1.49, 2.09, 2.2, 2.56, 2.8, 3.09]}, {"scene": "notice", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The resolution names November 16 and 23 as newspaper publication dates.", "t0": 23.7, "t1": 27.86, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Newspaper dates and the deadline", "heading": "The dates in the record", "source": "resolution", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "First publication", "value": "November 16"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Second publication", "value": "November 23"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Deadline", "value": "December 14"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.75, 1.02, 1.44, 1.95, 2.04, 2.63, 2.78, 3.24, 3.83]}, {"scene": "notice", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The stated deadline was December 14, just 28 days after the first listed publication.", "t0": 27.98, "t1": 32.96, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "28 days between dates"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.47, 0.95, 1.09, 1.52, 2.3, 2.52, 3.01, 3.36, 3.6, 3.72, 4.0, 4.3]}, {"scene": "notice", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The agency also did other outreach. The dates alone cannot establish when notice began.", "t0": 33.08, "t1": 37.5, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency", "text": "Other outreach", "mark": "Other outreach"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.57, 0.84, 1.02, 1.25, 1.89, 2.08, 2.35, 2.69, 3.0, 3.49, 3.7, 3.97]}, {"scene": "transfer", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Most of the balance carried forward from 2016, about 3.4 million dollars.", "t0": 37.72, "t1": 42.23, 